/// \defgroup grp_ini INI
/// \brief INI and data definition loading: the `INI` reader, block and
///        field parse tables, the subsystem legend and the load entry points.
///
/// The `INI` class reads the game's text data a line at a time, hands each
/// block to the parser registered for its keyword, and fills objects
/// through `FieldParse` tables that map field names to parse functions and
/// member offsets. `SubsystemLegend.ini` lists, by subsystem name, files
/// and directories that engine subsystems load. \ref sub_ini describes the
/// subsystem, how loads are driven at startup and per map, its differences
/// from Zero Hour and what it means for modding and remastering.
